tion.html\nEND FUNCTION\n\nCLASS UserManager\n    FUNCTION register(username: str, password: str, email: str) -> bool\n        FOR each user IN users\n            IF user.username == username\n                RETURN False\n            ENDIF\n        ENDFOR\n        new_user = User(username, password, email)\n        APPEND new_user to users\n        OPEN \'users.txt\' in append mode\n            WRITE username, password, and email in the format "username|password|email"\n        END OPEN\n        RETURN True\n    END FUNCTION\nEND CLASS\n```']
